{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 51, :comments ["<b>Because you dealt treacherously with Me, etc. Because you did not sanctify Me.</b> The sin of Moses in the matter of the rock is explicit from what he mentioned in another place (Numbers 20:24): ״על אשר מריתם את פי״ — because you rebelled against My mouth; and here he mentions מעלתם — that you did not sanctify Me, which is from the language of sign (אות), and therefore it is plene with a vav, with no parallel (לית כותיה) in the books of the Torah; and I have already mentioned the secret of the matter in its place."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:53:38.549596642Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}